":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"M1hsyjJDdQQeNP164FJ1pA","review_id":"ZjBix4F7zm4dfLI2nK2qiw","date":"2019-09-12T20:26:54","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9524745941162109,"text_excerpt":"***DISCLAIMER*** Get ready for a long read...it'll be worth it! Nestled into the pleasant uptown neighborhood on Prytania is this gem. I've been dying to get the opportunity to give St. James Cheese Company a try because of my affinity for what they, as I have come to find out for myself, do incredibly well: Cheese...and wine too! I finally was able to get some time to come visit this establishment with one of my dear friends who, come to find out, lives within walking distance of their uptown location. So I met her at her apartment and we strolled down Prytania on this gorgeous summer day with the breeze blowing gently. We walked up, and the first thing you see is their sign. You could s..."},{"business_id":"M1hsyjJDdQQeNP164FJ1pA","review_id":"T7P0PsdW3Cb4GdWpCUr8HQ","date":"2011-11-02T04:18:00","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9519873857498169,"text_excerpt":"Exquisite. I'm not a master of fancy cheeses and meats, but I am something of a fan. With that in mind, I really really enjoy the St. James Cheese Co. Sooooooooo delicious. I usually just slide in for a sandwich (all of the ones I've had rock pretty hard), but occasionally the lady snags a cheese or meat tray, which we then eat with much gusto. It's really a great place, and not just to take out from (though that is what I usually do). The interior is really well done, and there is out door seating for those beautiful New Orlea's afternoons. Dig it."},{"business_id":"M1hsyjJDdQQeNP164FJ1pA","review_id":"lzj4Vn9Hbim0JJxLo_-UfQ","date":"2011-06-06T14:48:05","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9456377625465393,"text_excerpt":"This place is sooo good. First off they have an AMAZING cheese selection for the city of New Orleans, everything from craft created domestic varieties from both local and other regional cheese crafters, to rare varieties from overseas. SO COOL! Usually they have a sample going of one or two of the dozens of offerings. They also have delicious and interesting meats to accompany your choice of cheese along with all the extras you need to throw a great cheese party. OH WAIT THERE'S MORE!! St. James also has DELICIOUS sandwiches, salads, plate lunches, and cheese boards that you can eat inside or on their lovely balcony or patio. All of the offerings use the fresh, unique cheeses they have fo..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"M1hsyjJDdQQeNP164FJ1pA","photo_id":"V8zRESluUx5vWAhMIRN14Q","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/V8zRESluUx5vWAhMIRN14Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.892857015132904},{"business_id":"M1hsyjJDdQQeNP164FJ1pA","photo_id":"JOgMei5KzTZn_C1iH7QUrA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/JOgMei5KzTZn_C1iH7QUrA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.891046404838562},{"business_id":"M1hsyjJDdQQeNP164FJ1pA","photo_id":"F1nRVBxHgiaT_Bx6okzDnw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/F1nRVBxHgiaT_B